  "pages": [
    {
      "id": "page-1",
      "width": 850,
      "height": 1100,
      "regions": [
        {
          "id": "p1-st",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 45,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 42,
          "html": "<p><strong style=\"font-size: 22px\">CÁLCULO SIMBÓLICO Y RESOLUCIÓN</strong></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-sn",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 105,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 42,
          "html": "<p>Simplificación, expansión, factorización, derivadas, integrales y raíces.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-s1",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 170,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{simplify}\\left(x+0+x\\right)",
          "ascii": "simplify(x + 0 + x)"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-s2",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 240,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{expand}\\left(\\left(x+1\\right)^{2}\\right)",
          "ascii": "expand((x+1)^2)"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-s3",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 310,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{factor}\\left(x^{2}-4\\right)",
          "ascii": "factor(x^2 - 4)"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-s4",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 380,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{diff}\\left(x^{3}+2x,x\\right)",
          "ascii": "diff(x^3 + 2*x, x)"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-s5",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 450,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{integrate}\\left(x^{2},x\\right)",
          "ascii": "integrate(x^2, x)"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-s6",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 520,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{integral}\\left(\\sin\\left(x\\right),x,0,\\pi\\right)",
          "ascii": "integral(sin(x), x, 0, pi)"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-s7",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 590,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{solve}\\left(x^{2}-5x+6,x\\right)",
          "ascii": "solve(x^2 - 5*x + 6, x)"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-s8",
          "type": "math",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 660,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 55,
          "source": "\\text{polyroots}\\left(\\left[1,0,1\\right]\\right)",
          "ascii": "polyroots([1, 0, 1])"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-s9",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 735,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 66,
          "html": "<p>Las funciones simbólicas devuelven expresiones legibles. <strong>integral</strong> calcula integrales definidas numéricamente; <strong>solve</strong> y <strong>polyroots</strong> incluyen raíces complejas cuando existen.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-2",
      "width": 850,
      "height": 1100,
      "regions": [
        {
          "id": "p2-mt",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 45,
          "w": 730,
          "h": 42,
          "html": "<p><strong style=\"font-size: 22px\">MATRICES Y VECTORES AVANZADOS</strong></p>"
